 "comment": "The village of Ostby, the first hub of the first playable (D-1344, D-1354). The run starts in the house of Marrek, in the north-west, where the entry trigger plays the opening scene one time: Hadda shows inside the door, walks up to Marrek, and leaves the way she came. The chest of the house holds a gift. Three villagers stand in the lanes, and a talk with each plays two lines. The road runs east to the edge of the map, where the exit leads to the overworld beside the village. A hub, so it holds no enemy, and it holds no service (D-369). The village is day, and night after the end of the first playable (D-1338, D-1349).",
